<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh July inflation 0.7 pct vs 0.8 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Kazakh July inflation 0.7 pct vs 0.8 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's consumer price inflation slowed to 0.7 percent in July from 0.8 percent in June, the National Statistics Agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES    July '97    June '97    July '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change   +0.7	  +0.8	  +1.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change    +16.4	 +17.6	 +39.9</p>
<p>The National Bank expects inflation to fall to 17 percent this year from 28.7 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
